  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Información básica",
    "@en": "Background information"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "En un anuncio de alquiler aparecen el **leiebolig** (vivienda de alquiler), la **husleie** (renta mensual) y el **depositum** (depósito o fianza). **Utleier** es quien alquila la vivienda; **leietaker**, quien la ocupa pagando.",
     "@en": "A rental announcement includes the **leiebolig** (rental housing), the **husleie** (monthly income) and the **depositum** (deposit or bail). **Utleier** is the one who rents the house; **leietaker**, who occupies it by paying for it."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Describir la vivienda",
    "@en": "Describe the housing"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**Romslig** significa espacioso/a y **sentral**, céntrico/a. **Inkludert** indica que un gasto está incluido. En noruego, **strøm** puede referirse a la electricidad que se paga aparte.",
     "@en": "**Romslig** means spacious / a and **sentral**, central. **Inkludert** indicates that an expense is included. In Norwegian, **strøm** can refer to the electricity that is paid for separately."
    }
   ]
  },
